{"content_hash": "def98468c5381bb3", "version_id": 824, "article_id": 83, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "OnePlus launches Ace 7 series with 185Hz screen and 9,000mAh battery", "title_zh": "一加发布 Ace 7 系列：185Hz 屏幕加 9000mAh 大电池", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84273", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NHx8YWNlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM0MDgzMDd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(269, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(307, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "cb8d01654671"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-31", "word_count": 263, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "OnePlus unveiled its new Ace 7 and Ace 7 Pro phones on October 29, promising flagship-level performance for gamers. Both models bring faster screens, bigger batteries and upgraded cameras, with prices starting at 3,249 yuan.", "lead_zh": "10 月 29 日，一加推出 Ace 7 和 Ace 7 Pro 两款新机，主打面向游戏玩家的旗舰级性能。两款手机都升级了屏幕、电池和影像，起售价 3249 元。", "preview": "The series comes in classic black and white, plus two new finishes. The Ace 7 Pro's light blue glass back uses a layered texture and frost e", "preview_zh": "该系列有经典的黑白两色，另加两款新配色。Ace 7 Pro 的浅蓝色玻璃后盖采用叠层纹理与冰霜蚀刻，营造出风暴般的纹路；Ace 7 则用橙色搭配银色哑光质感。两款手机都具备防尘防水能力，采用金属中框，凸起的摄像头区域还能改善散热进风。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 805, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 122.25, "size_bytes": 734400, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 124.625, "size_bytes": 748656, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 133.55, "size_bytes": 802224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 113.975, "size_bytes": 684864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 123.65, "size_bytes": 742896, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@91b304e/content/data/versions/824.json", "paragraphs": ["The series comes in classic black and white, plus two new finishes. The Ace 7 Pro's light blue glass back uses a layered texture and frost etching to create a storm-like pattern, while the Ace 7 pairs orange with silver in a matte finish. Both phones are dust- and water-resistant, with metal frames and a raised camera island that also improves cooling airflow.", "All models feature a 185Hz display co-developed with BOE, using new X4 light-emitting material and LTPO circuitry. This delivers 185Hz in games and 165Hz across the system while keeping power use low. Eye-care features such as hardware-level low blue light and 3840Hz PWM dimming are included as well.", "The Ace 7 Pro runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite, while the Ace 7 uses the V Series version of the same chip. Both pack a new gaming engine, three dedicated gaming chips and the first dual-channel cooling system. A display chip called P4 and a network chip called G3 aim to make fast-moving images clearer and connections more stable.", "Both phones carry a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x periscope telephoto lens with up to 120x digital zoom. The Pro also supports 8K video and 4K at 120fps. A 9,000mAh battery with 100W charging lets users play while plugged in without overheating, and ColorOS 17 brings AI features.", "The Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan for 12GB+256GB and reaches 5,749 yuan for 16GB+1TB. The Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan, with four configurations in total. Government subsidies can cut the price by up to 500 yuan."], "paragraphs_zh": ["该系列有经典的黑白两色，另加两款新配色。Ace 7 Pro 的浅蓝色玻璃后盖采用叠层纹理与冰霜蚀刻，营造出风暴般的纹路；Ace 7 则用橙色搭配银色哑光质感。两款手机都具备防尘防水能力，采用金属中框，凸起的摄像头区域还能改善散热进风。", "全系配备与京东方联合开发的 185Hz 屏幕，采用全新 X4 发光材料和 LTPO 电路。游戏时可达 185Hz，系统全局 165Hz，同时功耗更低。硬件级低蓝光和 3840Hz 高频 PWM 调光等护眼功能也一并保留。", "Ace 7 Pro 搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版，Ace 7 则使用同架构的 V Series 版本。两款机型都配备全新游戏内核、三颗电竞芯片以及首发的双路风冷系统。名为 P4 的显示芯片和 G3 网络芯片，旨在让高速画面更清晰、网络连接更稳定。", "两款手机都配备 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 版另加 3.5 倍潜望长焦，最高支持 120 倍数码变焦，还能拍摄 8K 视频和 4K/120fps 视频。9000mAh 电池搭配 100W 闪充，边玩边充也不易发烫，ColorOS 17 则带来多项 AI 功能。", "Ace 7 Pro 12GB+256GB 起售价 3649 元，16GB+1TB 顶配为 5749 元。Ace 7 起售价 3249 元，共四种配置。使用国补还能再减最多 500 元。砂岩磁吸保护壳单独售价 99 元，与手机一起购买为 69 元。"], "body": "The series comes in classic black and white, plus two new finishes. The Ace 7 Pro's light blue glass back uses a layered texture and frost etching to create a storm-like pattern, while the Ace 7 pairs orange with silver in a matte finish. Both phones are dust- and water-resistant, with metal frames and a raised camera island that also improves cooling airflow.\n\nAll models feature a 185Hz display co-developed with BOE, using new X4 light-emitting material and LTPO circuitry. This delivers 185Hz in games and 165Hz across the system while keeping power use low. Eye-care features such as hardware-level low blue light and 3840Hz PWM dimming are included as well.\n\nThe Ace 7 Pro runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite, while the Ace 7 uses the V Series version of the same chip. Both pack a new gaming engine, three dedicated gaming chips and the first dual-channel cooling system. A display chip called P4 and a network chip called G3 aim to make fast-moving images clearer and connections more stable.\n\nBoth phones carry a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x periscope telephoto lens with up to 120x digital zoom. The Pro also supports 8K video and 4K at 120fps. A 9,000mAh battery with 100W charging lets users play while plugged in without overheating, and ColorOS 17 brings AI features.\n\nThe Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan for 12GB+256GB and reaches 5,749 yuan for 16GB+1TB. The Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan, with four configurations in total. Government subsidies can cut the price by up to 500 yuan.", "body_zh": "该系列有经典的黑白两色，另加两款新配色。Ace 7 Pro 的浅蓝色玻璃后盖采用叠层纹理与冰霜蚀刻，营造出风暴般的纹路；Ace 7 则用橙色搭配银色哑光质感。两款手机都具备防尘防水能力，采用金属中框，凸起的摄像头区域还能改善散热进风。\n\n全系配备与京东方联合开发的 185Hz 屏幕，采用全新 X4 发光材料和 LTPO 电路。游戏时可达 185Hz，系统全局 165Hz，同时功耗更低。硬件级低蓝光和 3840Hz 高频 PWM 调光等护眼功能也一并保留。\n\nAce 7 Pro 搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版，Ace 7 则使用同架构的 V Series 版本。两款机型都配备全新游戏内核、三颗电竞芯片以及首发的双路风冷系统。名为 P4 的显示芯片和 G3 网络芯片，旨在让高速画面更清晰、网络连接更稳定。\n\n两款手机都配备 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 版另加 3.5 倍潜望长焦，最高支持 120 倍数码变焦，还能拍摄 8K 视频和 4K/120fps 视频。9000mAh 电池搭配 100W 闪充，边玩边充也不易发烫，ColorOS 17 则带来多项 AI 功能。\n\nAce 7 Pro 12GB+256GB 起售价 3649 元，16GB+1TB 顶配为 5749 元。Ace 7 起售价 3249 元，共四种配置。使用国补还能再减最多 500 元。砂岩磁吸保护壳单独售价 99 元，与手机一起购买为 69 元。", "text": "The series comes in classic black and white, plus two new finishes. The Ace 7 Pro's light blue glass back uses a layered texture and frost etching to create a storm-like pattern, while the Ace 7 pairs orange with silver in a matte finish. Both phones are dust- and water-resistant, with metal frames and a raised camera island that also improves cooling airflow. All models feature a 185Hz display co-developed with BOE, using new X4 light-emitting material and LTPO circuitry. This delivers 185Hz in games and 165Hz across the system while keeping power use low. Eye-care features such as hardware-level low blue light and 3840Hz PWM dimming are included as well. The Ace 7 Pro runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite, while the Ace 7 uses the V Series version of the same chip. Both pack a new gaming engine, three dedicated gaming chips and the first dual-channel cooling system. A display chip called P4 and a network chip called G3 aim to make fast-moving images clearer and connections more stable. Both phones carry a 200-megapixel main camera, and the Pro adds a 3.5x periscope telephoto lens with up to 120x digital zoom. The Pro also supports 8K video and 4K at 120fps. A 9,000mAh battery with 100W charging lets users play while plugged in without overheating, and ColorOS 17 brings AI features. The Ace 7 Pro starts at 3,649 yuan for 12GB+256GB and reaches 5,749 yuan for 16GB+1TB. The Ace 7 starts at 3,249 yuan, with four configurations in total. Government subsidies can cut the price by up to 500 yuan.", "vocab": [{"word": "unveil", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布，揭晓", "note": "常用于新品发布，比 launch 更强调首次亮相", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "noun/adj", "zh": "旗舰（的）", "note": "指品牌最高端的产品线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "finish", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（表面）工艺，饰面", "note": "手机配色常用词，如 matte finish", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "water-resistant", "pos": "adj", "zh": "防水的", "note": "比 waterproof 弱，指不易进水", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "co-develop", "pos": "verb", "zh": "联合开发", "note": "co- 前缀表示共同", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "circuitry", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电路系统", "note": "集合名词，指整套电路", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dedicated", "pos": "adj", "zh": "专用的", "note": "如 dedicated chip 专用芯片", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "telephoto lens", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "长焦镜头", "note": "摄影常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "digital zoom", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "数码变焦", "note": "与 optical zoom 光学变焦相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "configuration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置组合", "note": "指内存与存储的不同搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "subsidy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "补贴", "note": "government subsidy 政府补贴", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overheat", "pos": "verb", "zh": "过热", "note": "电子设备常见问题", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-31T00:58:25.335332", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.338, "sm": 250, "em": 337, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "series", "s": 0.338, "e": 0.725, "sm": 337, "em": 724, "cs": 4, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "comes", "s": 0.725, "e": 1.0, "sm": 725, "em": 1000, "cs": 11, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "in", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.15, "sm": 1000, "em": 1149, "cs": 17, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "classic", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.575, "sm": 1150, "em": 1575, "cs": 20, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "black", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1575, "em": 1950, "cs": 28, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "and", "s": 1.95, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1950, "em": 2075, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "white", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2075, "em": 2624, "cs": 38, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ",", "s": 2.625, "e": 2.725, "sm": 2625, "em": 2725, "cs": 43, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "plus", "s": 2.725, "e": 3.013, "sm": 2725, "em": 3012, "cs": 45, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "two", "s": 3.013, "e": 3.225, "sm": 3012, "em": 3224, "cs": 50, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "new", "s": 3.225, "e": 3.4, "sm": 3225, "em": 3399, "cs": 54, "ce": 57, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "finishes", "s": 3.4, "e": 4.4, "sm": 3400, "em": 4400, "cs": 58, "ce": 66, "si":